    "EMT_homogeneousOffDiagonalForms_G3_formulas": "T_ij = +(1/4) eps_i eps_j h_i h_j (H_i - H_j) Psibar gamma^(i) gamma^(j) gamma^(4) Psi (i!=j, both !=4); T_4i = -(1/4) eps_i h_i (Psibar gamma^(i) d_4 Psi - d_4 Psibar gamma^(i) Psi); H_i = h_i'/h_i, gamma^(a) flat, eps = eta diagonal",
    "EMT_variation_minisuperspace_setup": "minisuperspace: diagonal vielbein diag(h_0..h_7)(x4), lapse N = h_4, symbolic h_mu and h_mu'; homogeneous fields Psi(x4); exact random rational field jets, off-shell",
    "EMT_variation_diagonalLocal_setup": "diagonal vielbein diag(h_0..h_7) with symbolic h_mu and symbolic d_nu h_mu (all nu); exact random rational field jets, off-shell",
    "GEO_lichnerowicz_statement": "(gamma^mu D_mu)^2 Psi = g^{mu nu} nabla_mu D_nu Psi + c R Psi with c = -1/4; R = g^{sn} R^r_{s r n}, R^r_{s m n} = d_m Gamma^r_{ns} - d_n Gamma^r_{ms} + Gamma^r_{ml} Gamma^l_{ns} - Gamma^r_{nl} Gamma^l_{ms}",
    "GEO_spinCurvature_statement": "F_{mu nu} = d_mu Omega_nu - d_nu Omega_mu + [Omega_mu, Omega_nu] = (1/2) R_{ab mu nu} S^{ab}, R_{ab mu nu} = eta_ac e_r^c R^r_{s mu nu} e_b^s",
    "EMT_signConvention": "T_{mu nu} = -(2/sqrt|g|) dS/dg^{mu nu} reproduces CONTRACT section 7 exactly: T^mu_mu(no sum) = (h_mu/sqrt|g|) dL/dh_mu for diagonal e = diag(h); rho = T_44/N^2 = -(N/sqrt|g|) dL/dN; p_i = T^i_i = (h_i/sqrt|g|) dL/dh_i; homogeneous: rho = m S + U, p = L_s (= S U' - U on shell)",
    "EMT_traceStatement": "T^mu_mu = 7 K - 8 (m S + U) off shell; on shell T^mu_mu = -m S + 7 S U' - 8 U (= -m S + 3 lam S^2 for U = lam S^2/2)",
    "LAG_commutingProxyJustification": "Commuting proxy: the Lagrangian is bilinear in (Psibar-jets, Psi-jets) and every term is written with the Psibar factor (Psi^* or d_mu Psi^*) to the LEFT of the Psi factor. The Grassmann left derivative d/dPsi^*_a acts on that leftmost factor without any sign, so term by term it equals the ordinary derivative of the same polynomial in commuting symbols; the EL expression is linear in the Psi-jets, hence evaluating it on commuting exact rationals is exact. (For the Psi-equation the Grassmann result differs from the commuting one only by an overall sign.) The genuine Grassmann computation is repeated in demo_grassmann_lagrangians.py.",
